# frank

--- HammerDude_Immunity | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_FRANK_CC_IMMUNITY_DESC
raw  Fires a soundwave in a target direction, dealing <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage to Brawlers. Frank becomes immune to Crowd Control for <!card.accessory.skill.activationSelfStatusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> secs.
now  Fires a soundwave in a target direction, dealing 1200 damage to Brawlers. Frank becomes immune to Crowd Control for <!card.accessory.skill.activationSelfStatusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> secs.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel  1200  -> 1200
  card.accessory.skill.activationSelfStatusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds  -  -> 3.5

--- HammerDude_Immunity | gadget | TID_HAMMERDUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Fires a soundwave in a target direction, dealing <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage to Brawlers. Frank becomes immune to Crowd Control for <!card.accessory.skill.activationSelfStatusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> secs. Soundwave also destroys enemy projectiles.
now  Fires a soundwave in a target direction, dealing 1200 damage to Brawlers. Frank becomes immune to Crowd Control for <!card.accessory.skill.activationSelfStatusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> secs. Soundwave also destroys enemy projectiles.
