  card.accessory.skill.activationSelfStatusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds  -  -> 3.5

--- HammerDude_Pull | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_FRANK_PULL_DESC
raw  Frank aims a long-range attack that pulls enemies towards him. Consumes ammo. Does <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage.
now  Frank aims a long-range attack that pulls enemies towards him. Consumes ammo. Does 2480 damage.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel  2480  -> 2480

--- HammerDude_Pull | gadget | TID_HAMMERDUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Frank aims a long range attack that pulls enemies towards him. Consumes ammo. Does <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage. Slows enemies for <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.statusEffectEnemy.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Frank aims a long range attack that pulls enemies towards him. Consumes ammo. Does 2480 damage. Slows enemies for 2 sec.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel  2480  -> 2480
  buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.statusEffectEnemy.duration.ticksAsSeconds  2  -> 2

--- HammerDude_Pull | gadget | TID_HAMMERDUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DIFF
